{"id":65,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"地域と世界を見据える県立中高一貫教育","feature_description":"佐賀県立香楠中学校は、県立中高一貫教育校として、基礎学力と主体的に学ぶ姿勢を育てる学校です。地域への理解、探究的な活動、学校行事を通して、生徒が自分の将来や社会との関わりを考える力を伸ばします。6年間を見通した教育の中で、仲間と協働しながら目標に向かう力を養います。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1277,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1278,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1279,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1280,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1281,"name":"競技かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1282,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1283,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1284,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1285,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1286,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/kounanchuugakkou/?sub_page=%